==Latvian==
{{head|lv|letter|||upper case|Ch|lower case|ch}}

# A letter used in older, pre-World-War-II Latvian spelling, but now replaced everywhere by [[h]].

====Usage notes====
This letter can still be found in older books, or in books written by the Latvian diaspora prior to the fall of the Soviet Union. It used to represent the sound /x/, as distinct from /h/; but since these sounds have merged as /x/ in current Latvian pronunciation, <h> is now used in all cases.

